  "description": "Answer Engine Optimization for Umbraco. Exposes your published content to\n      LLMs and AI answer engines by dynamically serving an /llms.txt index, an\n      /llms-full.txt full-content dump, and a Markdown rendering of any page when\n      the URL ends in \".md\" — all generated from the live content cache, no\n      editor work required. Zero-config install via an Umbraco pipeline filter;\n      fully configurable through appsettings.",
